  'William and Lucy Hart asked Carnegie in 1914 and got $20,000; the Midland Improvement Company, the land arm of Crucible Steel, gave the ground. Built in 1916 to designs by Frederick J. Merrick. The basement was raised for bigger windows when it also served as Midland High School\'s library, and the children\'s room has a fireplace nook.',
